1
00:00:00,912 --> 00:00:02,412
- Why?
- Come on.

2
00:00:02,622 --> 00:00:05,962
You were gonna go in a rocket
designed in the 1960s by the Russians.

3
00:00:06,168 --> 00:00:07,378
(Howard:)Yeah, so?

4
00:00:07,586 --> 00:00:09,836
(Leonard:)When was the last time
you heard someone say:

5
00:00:10,046 --> 00:00:13,756
"Ooh, check out this Blu-ray player.
It must be good, it was buiIt in Russia"?

6
00:00:15,969 --> 00:00:18,219
(Howard:)Well, their technology isn't that bad.

7
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:22,020
(Raj:)When you come back to Earth in a Soyuz
capsule, you free-fall from space...

8
00:00:22,225 --> 00:00:25,475
(Raj:)...at 500 miles per hour, and the only
thing that slows you down...

9
00:00:25,687 --> 00:00:28,937
...is a parachute that pops out
before you crash into the ground.

10
00:00:29,149 --> 00:00:31,609
The thing was designed
by the same brilliant minds...

11
00:00:31,818 --> 00:00:34,818
(Raj:)...who were unable to capture
Rocky and Bullwinkle.

12
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:39,240
(Howard:)All right, well, whatever.
l wasn't worried.

13
00:00:39,451 --> 00:00:40,491
(Raj:)You weren't?

14
00:00:40,702 --> 00:00:44,042
Okay, let me explain
the difference between you and me.

15
00:00:44,664 --> 00:00:48,414
(Howard:)You watch Star Trek, I live it.

16
00:00:50,170 --> 00:00:52,340
Oh, I don't remember
the episode of Star Trek...

17
00:00:52,547 --> 00:00:56,547
(Raj:)...where the guy never goes to space
and brags about it in a tuxedo store.

18
00:00:56,760 --> 00:01:00,140
(Howard:)Make all the jokes you want, but there's
only one of us brave enough...

